---
import { motors, parts } from "../lib/catalogue";
---

<details class="full-compatibility">
  <summary>
    <span class="disclosure-title">
      Full compatibility tables
      <span class="disclosure-meta">
        {motors.rows.length} motor families · {parts.rows.length} other
        component groups
      </span>
    </span>
  </summary>
  <div class="expanded-matrix">
    <p class="matrix-intro">
      Android supports STEPS drive units over Bluetooth LE. Di2 component
      settings are available in the web app and CLI. Bootloader recovery
      requires the CLI and an SM-PCE02 USB adapter.
    </p>
    <p class="scroll-help">
      Scroll across to see every column. Motor and component names stay visible.
    </p>
    <div
      class="matrix-scroll"
      tabindex="0"
      role="region"
      aria-labelledby="motor-matrix-caption"
    >
      <table class="matrix-table motors">
        <caption id="motor-matrix-caption">Motors</caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            {motors.columns.map((column) => (
              <th scope="col">{column}</th>
            ))}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {motors.rows.map((row) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{row[0]}</th>
              {row.slice(1).map((cell) => (
                <td>{cell}</td>
              ))}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <dl class="matrix-key">
      <div>
        <dt>Tested on a bike</dt>
        <dd>Confirmed on physical hardware.</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Preview</dt>
        <dd>
          Implemented and checked against the protocol in software; physical
          bike confirmation is in progress.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>—</dt>
        <dd>Not applicable or not supported.</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <div class="matrix-footnotes">
      <p>
        ¹ Command line only, with <code>--allow-unverified-model</code>. Not run
        on hardware.
      </p>
      <p>
        ² DU-EP800 shares the EP800-CRG’s identity (<code>23/00</code>) and
        firmware, so the CLI accepts it without{" "}
        <code>--allow-unverified-model</code>. Recovery has not been run on that
        model’s hardware.
      </p>
      <p>
        E7000, E6100 and older E6000-family motors keep their factory region.
        Available fields depend on firmware and device permissions. Recovery
        requires an intact bootloader and your own firmware files.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="matrix-scroll"
      tabindex="0"
      role="region"
      aria-labelledby="parts-matrix-caption"
    >
      <table class="matrix-table parts">
        <caption id="parts-matrix-caption">
          Other components · web app and CLI
        </caption>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            {parts.columns.map((column) => (
              <th scope="col">{column}</th>
            ))}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {parts.rows.map((row) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{row[0]}</th>
              {row.slice(1).map((cell) => (
                <td>{cell}</td>
              ))}
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="matrix-footnotes component-notes">
      <p>
        12-speed levers (wired and wireless) and SW-EN600 / SW-EM800 switches
        have no settings support yet. Implemented component layouts have
        protocol tests but have not been validated on physical hardware.
      </p>
      <p>
        Tables are built from the repository README.{" "}
        <a href="https://github.com/plainoss/cranklink#supported-parts">
          Full source & support notes ↗
        </a>{" "}
        ·{" "}
        <a href="https://github.com/plainoss/cranklink/blob/main/docs/settings.md">
          Settings reference ↗
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
<style>
  .full-compatibility {
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 24px 12px 24px 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  summary::after {
    content: "+";
    font: 25px monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  details[open] > summary::after {
    content: "−";
  }
  summary:hover .disclosure-title {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .disclosure-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .disclosure-meta {
    display: block;
    font: 10px/1.7 monospace;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }
  .expanded-matrix {
    padding-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .matrix-intro {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin: 0 0 15px;
  }
  .scroll-help {
    font: 10px/1.7 monospace;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .matrix-scroll {
    overflow: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 580px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .matrix-scroll:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .matrix-table {
    border-collapse: separate;
    border-spacing: 0;
    table-layout: fixed;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .motors {
    min-width: 1080px;
  }
  .parts {
    min-width: 920px;
  }
  .matrix-table caption {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 15px 18px;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--muted);
    font: 12px/1.6 monospace;
  }
  .matrix-table th,
  .matrix-table td {
    padding: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .matrix-table thead th {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    z-index: 2;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .matrix-table th:first-child {
    position: sticky;
    left: 0;
    width: 210px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
    z-index: 1;
    padding-left: 18px;
  }
  .matrix-table thead th:first-child {
    z-index: 3;
  }
  .matrix-table tbody th {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .motors thead th:nth-child(2) {
    width: 150px;
  }
  .motors thead th:nth-child(3) {
    width: 300px;
  }
  .motors thead th:nth-child(4) {
    width: 260px;
  }
  .motors thead th:nth-child(5) {
    width: 160px;
  }
  .matrix-key {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 25px;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .matrix-key dt {
    font: 11px monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .matrix-key dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .matrix-footnotes {
    padding-block: 18px;
  }
  .matrix-footnotes p {
    font-size: 11px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    max-width: 950px;
  }
  .matrix-footnotes p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .matrix-footnotes code {
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .component-notes {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .disclosure-title {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .disclosure-meta {
      font-size: 9px;
    }
    .matrix-table th:first-child {
      width: 135px;
      padding-left: 15px;
    }
    .matrix-scroll {
      max-height: 480px;
    }
    .matrix-key {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .matrix-key dt {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .matrix-table th,
    .matrix-table td {
      padding: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>
